     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Identifying intention and deadline",
     "texto": [
      "When reading a transcript, look for what action is requested, who must do it and by when. The expressions **innen klokka tre** («by three o'clock») and **før møtet** («before the meeting») set deadlines. This exercise assesses text reading and doesn't present a real recording."
     ],
